WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:03.120
You can manage your
OneDrive backup preferences

2
00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:04.443
from the Windows desktop.

3
00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:07.500
In the system tray on the lower right,

4
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.093
select the OneDrive icon.

5
00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.300
From the pop-up menu,

6
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:15.303
select the settings gear
icon, and then settings.

7
00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:19.773
In the OneDrive settings
menu, select Manage backup.

8
00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:24.180
A new window opens showing
which folders are backed up

9
00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:25.203
in your OneDrive.
